.DS_Store

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Build outputs
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/

# Logs
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Editor files
.idea/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
.vercel
