# Rust
/target/
# The WebAssembly core's wasm-bindgen output (`npm run wasm:build` in tests/,
# docs/RAIL-PLAN.md R0.13): rebuilt from source, never committed.
/core/rail-core-wasm/pkg/

# Golden oracle with PHF bodies written out (~137 MB); regenerate with
# `npm run golden:emit` in tests/. See testdata/golden/README.md.
/testdata/golden-full/
# The stats engine's rows written out (R2.1); same command.
/testdata/golden-stats-full/
# The all-in EV rows and analyses written out (R2.2); same command.
/testdata/golden-ev-full/

# Desktop app (app/): the Vite output is app/dist/ (covered above); Tauri
# regenerates its capability schemas on every build. Rust output goes to the
# workspace's /target/, bundles to /target/release/bundle/.
/app/src-tauri/gen/
